      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Schedule a social media post for a future date\n\n### How it works\n\n1. Runs when you click Execute Workflow.\n2. Schedules posts to X (Twitter) and LinkedIn for the date and time you set.\n\n### Setup steps\n\n- [ ] Install the SocialRobot community node and connect your SocialRobot API credential (API key: socialrobot.io, Scheduler -> API Keys).\n- [ ] Select your connected SocialRobot account in each Publish node.\n- [ ] Replace the example captions in the Publish nodes with your own text.\n- [ ] Confirm the schedule date in each Publish node, or map it from an upstream field.\n\n### Customization\n\nReplace the example content, then run the workflow to post everywhere at once. Run it any time to post, or connect a Schedule Trigger to automate it.",
